1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,614
Shady Acres: a rural town where children keep going missing, and something lives in

2
00:00:04,614 --> 00:00:05,185
the fields.

3
00:00:05,405 --> 00:00:07,155
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:10,655
Shuffle the Ancient Curse cards into a face-down deck.

5
00:00:10,875 --> 00:00:14,953
Put the Children card out, one Child meeple on the Altar of the Old Gods, and the

6
00:00:14,953 --> 00:00:15,909
others on the card.

7
00:00:16,129 --> 00:00:20,584
Put the Children Action token above any Minion or Killer Actions on the Finale card:

8
00:00:20,584 --> 00:00:21,804
the Children act first.

9
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:25,775
The Children card gives their health, Attack and Movement Values.

10
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:27,369
They're Enemies, but not Minions.

11
00:00:27,589 --> 00:00:31,685
They have their own action on the Children Action token, resolved at the start of

12
00:00:31,685 --> 00:00:34,365
the Killer phase, before any Minion or Killer Action.

13
00:00:34,365 --> 00:00:38,512
They don't resolve Killer or Minion actions on Terror cards unless a card says so.

14
00:00:38,732 --> 00:00:42,845
They act one at a time, starting with the Child closest to the Altar of the Old

15
00:00:42,845 --> 00:00:43,105
Gods.

16
00:00:43,933 --> 00:00:48,327
In every Upkeep, a Child spawns on the Altar of the Old Gods, unless all three are

17
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:50,952
already out or there are no Victims on the board.

18
00:00:51,172 --> 00:00:55,413
You can attack and kill Children. A dead Child goes back on the card, ready to spawn

19
00:00:55,413 --> 00:00:55,716
again.

20
00:00:55,936 --> 00:01:00,068
If several are in the space you attack, you attack them all and split the damage as

21
00:01:00,068 --> 00:01:01,461
you like. Any extra is lost.

22
00:01:02,267 --> 00:01:06,320
Victims will follow you into a space with Children, unless the Killer is also there.

23
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:10,993
In the Panic phase, Victims in a space with a Child panic if at least one Victim was

24
00:01:10,993 --> 00:01:11,895
killed that turn.

25
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,964
The Children abduct people as sacrifices.

26
00:01:14,964 --> 00:01:19,271
When a Child resolves the abduction icon in a space with a Victim, roll a die.

27
00:01:19,491 --> 00:01:22,169
On a one or two, the Victim is sacrificed and killed.

28
00:01:22,169 --> 00:01:26,362
Return the Child to the Altar, raise Bloodlust as normal, and put the Victim on the

29
00:01:26,362 --> 00:01:28,131
back of the top Ancient Curse card.

30
00:01:28,351 --> 00:01:32,523
On three to six, nothing happens. With no Victim in the Child's space, treat the

31
00:01:32,523 --> 00:01:33,983
abduction icon as an attack.

32
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:39,093
When three sacrificed Victims sit on the top Ancient Curse card, the Old Gods have

33
00:01:39,093 --> 00:01:42,862
been fed. Remove the Victims and reveal the Curse, putting it into play.

34
00:01:42,862 --> 00:01:44,485
Several can be in play at once.

35
00:01:44,705 --> 00:01:47,959
Dark Fields lets Children treat all Field spaces as adjacent.

36
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:52,279
Others include Decaying Earth, lose a health entering a Field, and Omen of Death,

37
00:01:52,279 --> 00:01:54,625
the Killer heals whenever he kills a Victim.

38
00:01:55,433 --> 00:01:59,465
Spaces with the corn icon are Field spaces, and plenty of cards hit them.

39
00:01:59,685 --> 00:02:03,911
The Fields Are Moving adds Field tokens to the Hayfield and Cow Pasture, making them

40
00:02:03,911 --> 00:02:04,464
Fields too.

41
00:02:04,684 --> 00:02:07,002
The Combine Keys let you drive the Combine:

42
00:02:07,002 --> 00:02:11,315
an extra space with Walk, and any Field you drive into is Harvested, no longer a

43
00:02:11,315 --> 00:02:11,639
Field.

44
00:02:12,467 --> 00:02:16,808
A few tips. The setup uses fourteen Victims on a cramped map, so they die fast.

45
00:02:16,808 --> 00:02:17,523
Rescue early.

46
00:02:17,743 --> 00:02:22,051
Deal with Children next to Victims before they abduct anyone, and plan your route to

47
00:02:22,051 --> 00:02:24,206
the search spaces, which all need detours.

48
00:02:24,206 --> 00:02:24,719
Good luck.

